# Air nitrogen dissociation reactions for the hybrid TCE/QK model (react tce/qk)
#
# Reactions flagged with the "A" (Arrhenius) style are evaluated with the TCE
# model; reactions flagged with the "Q" (Quantum) style are evaluated with the
# QK model.  This exercises both code paths from a single reaction file.

N2 + N2 --> N + N + N2
D Q 1.0 1.561e-18 3.321e-9 -1.6 -1.561e-18

N2 + N --> N + N + N
D A 1.0 1.561e-18 4.980e-8 -1.6 -1.561e-18
